1. [Next immediate task]
2. [Following task]
3. [After that]

## Quick Context

[Any context needed to resume work]

## Related Files

- `path/to/file1.ext` - [Why relevant]
- `path/to/file2.ext` - [Why relevant]

## Blockers / Questions

[Any issues or open questions]
```

