## Documentation Standards (Quick Reference)

### Folder Structure

```
_projects/YYYY-MM/YYYYMMDD.NN.project-name/
├── README.md                    # Project overview
├── next-task.md                # Quick resume
├── tasks/                      # Task tracking (T##_#_*.md)
├── checkpoints/                # Milestones (YYYY-MM-DD-*.md)
├── reference/                  # Technical docs
├── design-decisions/           # ADRs (optional)
├── wrong-assumptions/          # Learnings (optional)
└── dont-dos/                   # Anti-patterns (optional)
```

### File Naming

- **Always lowercase-hyphenated**: `my-file-name.md`
- **Checkpoints with dates**: `YYYY-MM-DD-description.md`
- **Exception**: `README.md` (uppercase by convention)

### Where Files Go

| Content Type | Folder |
|--------------|--------|
| Milestone/completion | `checkpoints/` |
| Technical design | `reference/` |
| Architecture decision | `design-decisions/` |
| Wrong assumption | `wrong-assumptions/` |
| Task plan | `tasks/` |
| Resume/status | `next-task.md` (root) |

